Trigger file for a dry run of the release workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml).

Edit this file in a commit whose message contains [dry-run] and push it: the release pipeline builds the three per-year bundles, signs
them with a throw-away certificate, builds the installer, smoke-tests it (install, upgrade, uninstall) and keeps the output as a build
artifact. It publishes nothing. Without [dry-run] in the message a push that touches only this file does nothing, because the version in
dist/RELEASE_VERSION already has its release.

Last dry run requested: 2026-10-04 (ninth: the v0.49.0 release candidate, which passed; the release itself followed in the next commit)
